      "field": "lead",
      "before": "The crop guide gives you the season and method. Your weather and soil decide whether today is a sensible day to begin. A head start only helps if the plants keep growing.",
      "after": "The crop guide gives you the season and method. Your weather and soil decide whether today is a sensible day to begin. In cold or wet weather, delay planting. A head start only helps if the plants keep growing."
    },
    {
      "field": "steps[1].text",
      "before": "Modules give early crops a start while outside soil is still cold. Sow at the crop’s depth, label with variety and date, and give the seedlings light and steady moisture. Use modules early in the year; later, a small outdoor nursery bed is often easier than nursing young outdoor crops through a hot greenhouse.",
      "after": "Modules in a greenhouse or on a windowsill give early crops a start while outside soil is still cold. Sow at the crop’s depth, label with variety and date, and give the seedlings light and steady moisture. Use modules early in the year; later, a small outdoor nursery bed is often easier than nursing young outdoor crops through a hot greenhouse."
    }
